# Dataset Overview

This dataset contains washing machine product listings collected from Flipkart and prepared for brand and market analysis. The dataset includes product specifications, pricing information, customer ratings, review counts, and premium technology features across multiple brands.

### Dataset Highlights

* 313 cleaned product records
* 10 major washing machine brands
* Product pricing and discount information
* Customer ratings and review counts
* Capacity, load type, and machine type details
* Premium feature indicators (AI, WiFi, Steam Wash, Heater, Inverter Technology)

### Brands Included

* BOSCH
* Godrej
* Haier
* IFB
* LG
* Samsung
* Thomson
* Voltas Beko
* Whirlpool
* realme TechLife

### Potential Use Cases

* Brand Comparison
* Competitive Intelligence
* Pricing Analysis
* Feature Adoption Analysis
* Customer Rating Analysis
* Product Positioning Studies

This dataset can be used for exploratory data analysis, visualization, feature engineering, and marketplace product analytics projects.
